  "post_title": "Este domingo finalizan las fiestas del barrio San Joaquín en Onda",
  "post_date": "2012-08-25 13:03:39",
  "post_name": "este-domingo-finalizan-las-fiestas-del-barrio-san-joaquin-en-onda",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>Este domingo, 26 de agosto, finalizan las fiestas del barrio San Joaqu&iacute;n, en Onda, que se han venido celebrando con gran animaci&oacute;n, como&nbsp;muestran las fotos del tradicional desfile de disfraces,&nbsp;desde el s&aacute;bado 18 de agosto.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/08/DSC_1319.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 321px\" /></p>\n<p>Los actos que quedan son los siguientes:</p>\n<p>S&aacute;bado 25<br />\n A las 17.30 horas. Entrada y suelta de vaquillas de la ganaderia El Mijares<br />\n A las 19.00 horas.Exhibici&oacute;n del toro de nombre Manos Largas, n&uacute;m.50, guarismo 7, de pelo<br />\n negro y de la ganaderia Javier Guardiola<br />\n A continuaci&oacute;n exhibici&oacute;n del toro de nombre Barbero, n&uacute;m. 21, guarimo 9, de pelo negro<br />\n entrepolado y de la ganaderia Viuda de Flores Tassara<br />\n A las 23.00 horas. Emboladas en las calles Padre Ten y Concepci&oacute;n<br />\n &nbsp;</p>\n<p>Domingo 26<br />\n A las 14.00 horas. Paella gigante<br />\n A las 23.30 horas. Pasacalle fin de fiesta amenizado por la charanga Marxa-xa, con la entonaci&oacute;n<br />\n del pobre de mi y encendido de bengalas. Al finalizar, nuestro espectacular trompetista nos<br />\n deleitar&aacute; con &ldquo;El Silencio&rdquo;.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressessantxotxim/dsc_1279.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1279\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressessantxotxim/dsc_1281.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1281\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressessantxotxim/dsc_1282.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1282\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressessantxotxim/dsc_1283.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1283\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressessantxotxim/dsc_1285.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1285\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressessantxotxim/dsc_1286.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1286\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressessantxotxim/dsc_1287.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1287\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressessantxotxim/dsc_1288.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1288\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressessantxotxim/dsc_1291.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1291\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressessantxotxim/dsc_1292.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1292\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressessantxotxim/dsc_1293.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1293\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressessantxotxim/dsc_1294.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1294\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressessantxotxim/dsc_1295.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1295\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressessantxotxim/dsc_1296.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1296\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressessantxotxim/dsc_1297.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1297\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfressessantxotxim/dsc_1298.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1298\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/disfresse